        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Add Claw doctor diagnostics",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- Adds a `core/doctor/claws-state` check for applied Claw provenance drift.\n- Reports missing, modified, unreadable, oversized, or unsafe Claw-managed workspace files; orphaned Claw refs without an apply record; missing, disabled, or changed inline MCP server config; and any future persisted connector refs as unsupported until OpenClaw has a stable connector setup path.\n- Wires the check into both structured doctor lint and the regular ordered doctor contribution flow.\n\n## Stack\n\n- RFC: openclaw/rfcs#27\n- Previous PR: #102406\n- Base branch: `user/giodl/claws-pr9-mcp`\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/claws/doctor.test.ts src/flows/doctor-core-checks.test.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts`\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/claws/schema.test.ts src/claws/provenance.test.ts src/claws/artifact-installers.test.ts src/claws/workspace.test.ts src/claws/lifecycle-state.test.ts src/claws/doctor.test.ts src/state/openclaw-state-db.test.ts src/cli/claws-cli.test.ts src/cli/plugins-cli.uninstall.test.ts src/claws/lifecycle.e2e.test.ts src/flows/doctor-core-checks.test.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `node scripts/check-no-conflict-markers.mjs`\n- `codex review -c model=gpt-5.5 --uncommitted`\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\n- Created a temporary workspace-only Claw, applied it with `claws apply --workspace ... --yes --json`, modified the Claw-managed `SOUL.md`, then ran `doctor --lint --only core/doctor/claws-state --json`.\n- Result: command exited `1` with `core/doctor/claws-state` warning for `claws.doctor-proof.workspace.soul` and message `Claw-managed workspace file has changed since apply`.\n\n## Not tested\n\n- Full `node scripts/run-tsgo.mjs --noEmit --pretty false`; this linked WSL worktree is missing `node_modules/.bin/tsgo`, so the script exits with `spawnSync .../node_modules/.bin/tsgo ENOENT` before typechecking.\n",
